{"4426730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "STILL WATCHING: The Night Caregiver", "steam_appid": 4426730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4784580, 4739240], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STILL WATCHING</strong> is an interactive horror anthology. It draws inspiration from found footage aesthetics and unsettling real-life stories. This isn't just another walking sim. It's an experience that bleeds into your actual room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/1b192e737f9941ed4cdcc0621028ac9c.webp?t=1787772403\" alt=\"line\" width=1292 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/9b04c6aa5b91fbd3061a1738ea98cb16.poster.avif?t=1787772403\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/9b04c6aa5b91fbd3061a1738ea98cb16.webm?t=1787772403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/9b04c6aa5b91fbd3061a1738ea98cb16.mp4?t=1787772403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EPISODE: The Night Caregiver</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darya thought heading to college in a new city meant a fresh start. Wrong. Her first week in the dorms with an unhinged roommate turned into a total nightmare. Desperate to get away, she rents a cheap place on the outskirts of town. She needs cash for rent, so she takes a job as a night caregiver for an elderly woman. It's just a quiet house with creaky floors. And a patient who's sleeping... or is she just pretending? What started as a simple gig spirals into a paranoid trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/89c322d0503c366ab4150c03bdc90b04.poster.avif?t=1787772403\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/89c322d0503c366ab4150c03bdc90b04.webm?t=1787772403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/89c322d0503c366ab4150c03bdc90b04.mp4?t=1787772403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/1b192e737f9941ed4cdcc0621028ac9c.webp?t=1787772403\" alt=\"line\" width=1292 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>📱 BREAKING THE FOURTH WALL 📱</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doesn't stop at your monitor. You can connect your actual smartphone to the gameplay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get texts and calls on your real phone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the game invading your personal space.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/1b192e737f9941ed4cdcc0621028ac9c.webp?t=1787772403\" alt=\"line\" width=1292 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🎙 INTEGRATION AND IMMERSION 🎙</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Control: Mic is live. Don't scream. You don't want to attract the attention of whatever is hiding in the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch Mode: Let your chat control the paranormal events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS Atmosphere: Authentic visual style that captures the anxiety of old tapes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/1b192e737f9941ed4cdcc0621028ac9c.webp?t=1787772403\" alt=\"line\" width=1292 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STILL WATCHING</strong> is an interactive horror anthology. It draws inspiration from found footage aesthetics and unsettling real-life stories. This isn't just another walking sim. It's an experience that bleeds into your actual room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/1b192e737f9941ed4cdcc0621028ac9c.webp?t=1787772403\" alt=\"line\" width=1292 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/9b04c6aa5b91fbd3061a1738ea98cb16.poster.avif?t=1787772403\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/9b04c6aa5b91fbd3061a1738ea98cb16.webm?t=1787772403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite