 doesn't stop at your monitor. You can connect your actual smartphone to the gameplay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get texts and calls on your real phone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the game invading your personal space.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/1b192e737f9941ed4cdcc0621028ac9c.webp?t=1787772403\" alt=\"line\" width=1292 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🎙 INTEGRATION AND IMMERSION 🎙</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Control: Mic is live. Don't scream. You don't want to attract the attention of whatever is hiding in the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch Mode: Let your chat control the paranormal events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS Atmosphere: Authentic visual style that captures the anxiety of old tapes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/extras/1b192e737f9941ed4cdcc0621028ac9c.webp?t=1787772403\" alt=\"line\" width=1292 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Your real smartphone is your only weapon... Sync your phone with the game and pray it doesn't ring while you're hiding in the closet.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Russian, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/7b7288a46a7c3c475f0fd3531d60e6c10fc0ef8b/header.jpg?t=1787772403", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426730/70c12251f5d58d2fcdcca3eda8876687db684649/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787772403",